    "en": "Nero Ops’s voice resounds: “Not fear. Order. Based on Compliance Ogre’s logic, we exclude individual emotions from the system.”\nMore text from Nero Ops floats in the space: “Schwa’s intervention may compromise system stability. Monitoring continues.”",
    "ja": "Neroの声が、温かくなる。"
